To the Privacy Officer at {{ broker.name }}:

{{ m.agent_line(agent) }}{% if law.extra.get("quebec") %}I am a resident of Quebec. Under the {{ law.title }} ({{ law.citation }}) and the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA), I request that you:

1. Delete all personal information about me (section 28) and stop disseminating it, including de-indexing any links to it (section 28.1).
2. Withdraw my consent to any collection, use or disclosure of my personal information, including for marketing.
3. Tell me what personal information you hold about me, where you got it, and who you have disclosed it to (sections 27 and 8).

{% else %}Under the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA, {{ law.citation }}), I request that you:

